{
  "esm": "2.4.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_bound_coriolis_v",
    "description": "The bound_coriolis north-face Coriolis + momentum-advection acceleration of the mom6_cgrid: CAv(i,j,k) = mom6_coriolis_clamp4(pvf_v(i,j,k), fu1, fu2, fu3, fu4) - KEy(i,j,k), the MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc bound_Coriolis law (the fu1..fu4 bounds and the min/max clamp at :1139-1150, then the -d(KE)/dy term at :1153-1156): fu1 = -av(i,j,k)*u(i,j+1,k), fu2 = -av(i,j,k)*u(i,j,k), fu3 = -av(i-1,j,k)*u(i-1,j+1,k), fu4 = -av(i-1,j,k)*u(i-1,j,k), the -av*u products at the two q-points at the ends of the north face (av the absolute vorticity, u the east-face velocities of the cells on each side of the face), with the raw potential-vorticity flux pvf_v (the sibling mom6_cgrid_pvf_v) clamped to their range and the meridional KE gradient KEy subtracted. Every region applies the one clamp template (the same as mom6_cgrid_bound_coriolis_u), each product written once. SOLID-WALL BOUNDARIES (a basin closed by land, MOM6's zero wall velocities): at i = 1 the velocities u(0,j)/u(0,j+1) sit on the closed west wall, so fu3 = fu4 = 0 (bound to 0) and the clamp range of the real west-column faces includes 0, as MOM6's min/max over fu1..fu4 does. At j = N_J (the north wall face itself) u(*,N_J+1) are velocities of the land row beyond, so fu1 = fu3 = 0 (the literal MOM6 value at a wall face, whose velocity is 0). The NW corner applies both. (Before this revision the wall regions copied the edge cell's own av/u into the out-of-domain slots, dropping 0 from the range on the whole i = 1 column of real faces.) The rule is a named-op rule (esm-spec 9.6.8), applied once per consumer equation as mom6_cgrid_bound_coriolis_v(pvf_v, av, u, KEy); all four params must be declared [i,j,k] fields (esm-spec 9.6.1 where clause).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["esd:rule", "family:mom6_cgrid", "grid:mom6_cgrid", "op:clamp", "order:0", "bc:wall", "axes:i,j,k"],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      },
      {
        "citation": "MOM6 source: MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc bound_Coriolis fu1..fu4 :1139-1150 and the -d(KE)/dy term :1153-1156; the face conventions of the mom6_cgrid grid.esm."
      }
    ]
  },
  "operator_imports": [{ "ref": "../grid.esm" }, { "ref": "../stencils/mom6_coriolis_clamp4.esm" }],
  "operators": {
    "mom6_cgrid_bound_coriolis_v": {
      "params": ["pvf_v", "av", "u", "KEy"],
      "match": { "op": "mom6_cgrid_bound_coriolis_v", "args": ["pvf_v", "av", "u", "KEy"] },
      "where": {
        "pvf_v": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "av": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "u": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] },
        "KEy": { "shape": ["i", "j", "k"] }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [[2, "N_I"], [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }], [1, "N_K"]],
          [[1, 1], [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }], [1, "N_K"]],
          [[2, "N_I"], ["N_J", "N_J"], [1, "N_K"]],
          [[1, 1], ["N_J", "N_J"], [1, "N_K"]]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["pvf_v", "av", "u", "KEy"],
            "ranges": { "i": [2, "N_I"], "j": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_coriolis_clamp4",
                  "bindings": {
                    "x": { "op": "index", "args": ["pvf_v", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "f1": {
                      "op": "-",
                      "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["u", "i", { "op": "+", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] }] }]
                    },
                    "f2": { "op": "-", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["u", "i", "j", "k"] }] }] },
                    "f3": {
                      "op": "-",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            { "op": "index", "args": ["av", { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                            { "op": "index", "args": ["u", { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }, { "op": "+", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "f4": {
                      "op": "-",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            { "op": "index", "args": ["av", { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                            { "op": "index", "args": ["u", { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["KEy", "i", "j", "k"] }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["pvf_v", "av", "u", "KEy"],
            "ranges": { "i": [1, 1], "j": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_J", 1] }], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_coriolis_clamp4",
                  "bindings": {
                    "x": { "op": "index", "args": ["pvf_v", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "f1": {
                      "op": "-",
                      "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["u", "i", { "op": "+", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"] }] }]
                    },
                    "f2": { "op": "-", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["u", "i", "j", "k"] }] }] },
                    "f3": 0.0,
                    "f4": 0.0
                  }
                },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["KEy", "i", "j", "k"] }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["pvf_v", "av", "u", "KEy"],
            "ranges": { "i": [2, "N_I"], "j": ["N_J", "N_J"], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_coriolis_clamp4",
                  "bindings": {
                    "x": { "op": "index", "args": ["pvf_v", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "f1": 0.0,
                    "f2": { "op": "-", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["u", "i", "j", "k"] }] }] },
                    "f3": 0.0,
                    "f4": {
                      "op": "-",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            { "op": "index", "args": ["av", { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] },
                            { "op": "index", "args": ["u", { "op": "-", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"] }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["KEy", "i", "j", "k"] }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["pvf_v", "av", "u", "KEy"],
            "ranges": { "i": [1, 1], "j": ["N_J", "N_J"], "k": [1, "N_K"] },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mom6_coriolis_clamp4",
                  "bindings": {
                    "x": { "op": "index", "args": ["pvf_v", "i", "j", "k"] },
                    "f1": 0.0,
                    "f2": { "op": "-", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [{ "op": "index", "args": ["av", "i", "j", "k"] }, { "op": "index", "args": ["u", "i", "j", "k"] }] }] },
                    "f3": 0.0,
                    "f4": 0.0
                  }
                },
                { "op": "index", "args": ["KEy", "i", "j", "k"] }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
